{"id":"e_tabli","lemma":"établi","pos":"adj","rank":3340,"glosses":["established"],"ipa":"/e.ta.bli/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fb/Fr-%C3%A9tabli.ogg/Fr-%C3%A9tabli.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"établie","masculinePlural":"établis","femininePlural":"établies"},"formAudio":{"établie":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bc/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-J%C3%A9r%C3%A9my-G%C3%BCnther-Heinz_J%C3%A4hnick-%C3%A9tablie.wav","établis":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/52/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-%C3%A9tablis.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Nous avons établi un accord.","en":"We have a deal.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"agreement"}]},{"text":"Elle a établi un nouveau record du monde.","en":"She set a new world record.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"new, novel"},{"g":"record"},{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"world"}]},{"text":"Newton a établi la loi de la gravitation.","en":"Newton established the law of gravity.","words":[{"g":"newton"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"law"},null,null,{"g":"gravitation"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"of the"]]},{"text":"Ils ont établi un nouveau record du plus long baiser.","en":"They set a new record for the longest kiss.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"new, novel"},{"g":"record"},{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"long"},{"g":"to kiss"}]},{"text":"Elles ont établi un nouveau record du plus long baiser.","en":"They set a new record for the longest kiss.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"new, novel"},{"g":"record"},{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"long"},{"g":"to kiss"}]}]}